{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/4184357c584c2c7b7b922db6eb4db7ce.webp?t=1774284546\" width=200 height=35 /></span> a procedurally generated galaxy, warping between star systems filled with unique planets, asteroid fields, and mysterious system-wide modifiers that change the rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.poster.avif?t=1774284546\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.webm?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.mp4?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push towards the glaxy core to unravel more events, all while staying one step ahead of the pursuing Galactic Horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  ____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e1a590bd9aadd5e6320f54288cb34ebd.webp?t=1774284546\" width=200 height=35 /></span><strong>\u00a0</strong>the resources you find by deploying fleets of automated mining drones and specialized mining ships. Establish fully automated crafting chains and profitable trade routes to build your industrial empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/72c2bebb502362e598c36ab5979d9ad3.poster.avif?t=1774284546\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/72c2bebb502362e598c36ab5979d9ad3.webm?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/72c2bebb502362e598c36ab5979d9ad3.mp4?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these riches are rarely undefended. Prepare to guard your mining operations from scavengers drawn to your activity and conquer hostile planets to exploit the valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ____________________________________________________________________________<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/042040b4ae09c0624d506e660de2b94f.webp?t=1774284546\" width=180 height=40 /></span>your power by researching technologies and unlocking powerful upgrades. Use your resources to build, and customize a fleet of combat, support  and drone ships. Equip your vessels with a vast array of weapons, each with randomized rarities and game-changing stat modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a1de3a2226d9f7bfc4c73a66f02e170a.poster.avif?t=1774284546\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a1de3a2226d9f7bfc4c73a66f02e170a.webm?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a1de3a2226d9f7bfc4c73a66f02e170a.mp4?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">____________________________________________________________________________\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a5a4e58e84dffc329c513834a29fb533.webp?t=1774284546\" width=270 height=35 /></span><strong>\u00a0</strong>the hostile forces that stand in your way. Command your custom fleets in real-time tactical combat, level up your command abilities to unlock potent rewards, and upgrade your equipment to turn the tide against an overwhelming enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e3a1235a1dc0e8cc8a5b3a718fec17d7.poster.avif?t=1774284546\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e3a1235a1dc0e8cc8a5b3a718fec17d7.webm?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e3a1235a1dc0e8cc8a5b3a718fec17d7.mp4?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Horde is relentless, their pursuit tireless. Every jump buys you precious time\u2014time to research, to build, to become stronger. Can you transform a single ship into a beacon of survival before the darkness consumes all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115040?t=1774284546","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115040?t=1774284546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/eedd91cd58f62191795579fc03b8fa36a82f5123/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774284546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/eedd91cd58f62191795579fc03b8fa36a82f5123/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774284546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/4184357c584c2c7b7b922db6eb4db7ce.webp?t=1774284546\" width=200 height=35 /></span> a procedurally generated galaxy, warping between star systems filled with unique planets, asteroid fields, and mysterious system-wide modifiers that change the rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.poster.avif?t=1774284546\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.webm?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/aee6fc2bcbed762a694ab9886bfa713c.mp4?t=1774284546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_par